1
00:00:00,414 --> 00:00:02,710
As Uke comes in to grab with both hands

2
00:00:02,711 --> 00:00:03,873
extend your arm

3
00:00:03,874 --> 00:00:08,793
turn and cut down in a big circular movement
so Uke comes all the way around

4
00:00:08,794 --> 00:00:09,840
Raise the arm back up

5
00:00:09,841 --> 00:00:11,257
step in behind,

6
00:00:11,558 --> 00:00:13,220
controlling the back of the neck

7
00:00:13,221 --> 00:00:14,261
cut down again,

8
00:00:14,562 --> 00:00:16,106
taking Uke´s balance

9
00:00:16,107 --> 00:00:17,097
as he comes back up,

10
00:00:17,098 --> 00:00:18,708
draw him tightly to your shoulder

11
00:00:18,709 --> 00:00:23,150
turn stepping deeply behind him and throw down.

